WEBVTT

00:04:57.793 --> 00:05:01.047
from feeling effective
to achieving our goals,

00:05:01.047 --> 00:05:02.715
to belonging to a group,

00:05:02.715 --> 00:05:05.634
to working for something
bigger than yourself.

00:05:06.177 --> 00:05:09.430
Describing his experience
in a top World of Warcraft guild,

00:05:09.472 --> 00:05:11.140
the player Wincy once wrote,

00:05:11.182 --> 00:05:13.059
"It felt so amazing...

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.437
Thinking back, it was probably
the most intense,

00:05:16.479 --> 00:05:19.023
positive emotional experience of my life.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.693
Not my kid being born,
not getting married."

00:05:22.735 --> 00:05:24.028
(Laughter)

00:05:24.028 --> 00:05:28.824
"My mind was convinced we were in a war
against an insurmountable foe

00:05:28.866 --> 00:05:30.159
and we won."